* A bubble sort of the values of an indexed letter.
1.1 Do part 2 for j = 1(1)n-i.

2.1 Do part 3 if a(j) > a(j+1).

3.1 Set t = a(j).
3.2 Set a(j) = a(j+1).
3.3 Set a(j+1) = t.

Set a(1) = 31.
Set a(2) = 4.
Set a(3) = 15.
Set a(4) = 92.
Set a(5) = 6.
Set a(6) = 53.
Set a(7) = 58.
Set n = 7.
Do part 1 for i = 1(1)n-1.
Type a.
    a(1) =       4
    a(2) =       6
    a(3) =      15
    a(4) =      31
    a(5) =      53
    a(6) =      58
    a(7) =      92
